-### Touch plate
-Put copper foil on printed pcb-masks, remove foil from holes. Eletrical and physical connect all pcb masks. Glue non copper side to pcb first side with double sided tape. Solder connection to copper side and connect to touch pin of microcontroller.
+This is 145 instances across four **unique** board designs, not the quantity for an assembled 19x19 board. `LED_BOM_CANDIDATE.csv` covers only these LEDs and is not a complete assembly BOM. `LED_PIN_AUDIT.csv` records all 580 LED pads. No firmware, other components, or original files were changed. Gerbers and assembly placement files are intentionally not included in this unreleased candidate.
 
